# Trivy ignore list (used by .github/workflows/security.yml and release.yml image gates).
#
# Keep this empty. If a finding must be accepted temporarily, add ONE line per vulnerability id
# with a justification comment above it, an owner and an expiry date, e.g.
#
#   # CVE-2099-0001: not reachable (feature X disabled in our build); owner @lumidren; expires 2099-01-31
#   CVE-2099-0001 exp:2099-01-31
#
# Trivy drops expired entries automatically, so accepted risks resurface for review.
